# Title: Potential CommandLine Path Traversal Via Cmd.EXE
# ID: 087790e3-3287-436c-bccf-cbd0184a7db1
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: xknow @xknow_infosec, Tim Shelton
# Date: 2020-06-11
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.003
# Description: Detects potential path traversal attempt via cmd.exe. Could indicate possible command/argument confusion/hijacking
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((((ParentCommandLine:*/c* OR ParentCommandLine:*/k* OR ParentCommandLine:*/r*)) OR ((cmdline:*/c* OR cmdline:*/k* OR cmdline:*/r*))) AND ((parent_name:*\\cmd.exe) OR (process_name:*\\cmd.exe) OR (OriginalFileName:"cmd.exe")) AND ((ParentCommandLine:"/../../") OR (cmdline:*/../../*))) AND -((cmdline:*\\Tasktop\\keycloak\\bin\\/../../jre\\bin\\java*)))
